OL,3,AHow is the US economy really doing
OL,4,Aunder President Trump?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has been
OL,7,Fboasting about the performance of the
OL,8,FUS economy ahead of the midterm
OL,9,Fcongressional elections, claiming he
OL,10,Fhas boosted incomes, reduced inflation
OL,11,Fand created jobs.
OL,13,FTrump has repeatedly said: "We have the
OL,14,Fhottest country anywhere in the world."
