OL,3,AHow is the US economy really doing
OL,4,Aunder President Trump?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the overall US economy is faring
OL,7,Fbetter than many expected after Trump
OL,8,Flaunched his sweeping "Liberation Day"
OL,9,Ftariffs in 2025, there's evidence those
OL,10,Fimport taxes and the impact of the
OL,11,FUS-Israel war with Iran have pushed up
OL,12,Finflation, with the harmful effects
OL,13,Ffelt by most American households.
OL,15,FThe US economy is also being helped by
OL,16,Fan AI investment boom, and could falter
OL,17,Fif that spending were to dry up.
